description:
Write in `solution.c`:

```c
void swap(int *a, int *b);
bool divide(int a, int b, int *quotient, int *remainder);
        /* false (and nothing stored) when b is 0; remainder may be NULL: then skip it */
bool min_max(const int *values, size_t count, int *min, int *max);
        /* false when count is 0 */
void sort3(int *a, int *b, int *c);   /* afterwards *a <= *b <= *c; use swap */
```

`bool` needs `#include <stdbool.h>`, `size_t` and `NULL` `#include <stddef.h>`.

